  "clarification": "The confusion may arise from oversimplified summaries calling it a demonstration of 'the power of priming,' but no single study establishes a 'law.' Moreover, this specific priming effect has faced replication challenges in later years (part of the 'priming wars' debate), though the broader idea of automatic social cognition remains influential."  
}

