If you're curious about wealth dynamics, I’d recommend looking into research from sources like the Federal Reserve’s Survey of Consumer Finances (on wealth inequality) or works by sociologists like Elizabeth Warren (on the fragility of middle-class security) or Michael Sandel (on the ethics of meritocracy). These offer nuanced insights far richer than reductive 'secrets.'"}

